    "Pin producer repository/domain/project/work/task, immutable commit/tree, result and bound Verification evidence.",
    "Use producer canonical reader and exact source APIs; require source-only execution complete, verification passed and local result durable.",
    "Receiver actually reads/qualifies those source results; records a NEW source-owner Input containing exact producer identity/pins/hash and receiving Task identity.",
    "A local qualification Task has its own Verification targeting itself and pinning that receiving Input. It remains incomplete until this work is actually done.",
    "Receiving implementation Task depends on the completed local qualification Task; root admission checks producer and receiver binding before actual dispatch.",
    "Keep source proof and source-owner attribution separate from native receiver authentication, shared delivery, formal completion and acceptance."
  ],
